# Faculty UI naming

In professor-facing UI (research data desk), **never use given names or informal first-name greetings**.

- Do: `Asst. Prof. Kong`, `Prof. Wang`, `Assoc. Prof. Lu`
- Do: `Asst. Prof. Kong — what data do you need?`
- Don't: `Kong's desk`, `Hi Kong`, `Welcome, Kong`

Derive labels from registry `title` + surname (`name_en` before comma, or last token).
